# TODO(crbug.com/557778450): These tests crash with a FATAL DCHECK passing
# Mach-port-backed shared memory over mojo's POSIX channel, which only
# supports SCM_RIGHTS FD passing. The fix, mojo's Mach-based channel
# (channel_mac.cc), calls mach_msg() directly, which tvOS SDK marks
# unavailable.
